<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Neptra Progress - (built 1984) 7,554 dwt sold to South Korean buyers for $6.2 million.</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS - Gulf Venture - (built 1978) 24,750 dwt plus sistership:</p>
<p>Gulf Wave - (built 1981) 25,401 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $5.3 million.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Pivot - (built 1975) 232,116 dwt sold to Indian breakers for $192 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final.</p>
</text>
